# crates/bgmail/src/actions.rs

## Purpose

GPUI action types for menus, shortcuts, and command dispatch.

## Ownership

- Owns: API surface of `crates/bgmail/src/actions.rs`.
- Does not own: sibling modules or crate-level policy (parent
  `.dox/crates/bgmail/src/AGENTS.md` and `.dox/crates/bgmail/AGENTS.md`).

## Local Contracts

- Every function/method (and top-level types when they encode contracts) in this
  file is listed under **API Catalog** with purpose and behavior.
- Update the matching entry in this `.rs.dox` when changing signatures or
  semantics. Prefer rustdoc alignment on public items.
- Visibility in entries (`pub` / `private`) reflects the source item.
- `#[cfg(test)]` items are included when they encode behavioral contracts.

## Work Guidance

- After adding/removing/renaming a function or type in `actions.rs`, update this
  file in the same change.
- Do not weaken parent DOX contracts from root / `crates/` / `bgmail/` / `src/`.

## Verification

- `cargo test -p bgmail`
- Workspace `fmt` / `clippy -D warnings` as required by root `AGENTS.md`.

## Child DOX Index

_(none)_

## API Catalog

#### Types / constants

- **actions `Quit`, `ToggleCommandPalette`, `ComposeNew`, `OpenSettings`, `ToggleSidebar`, `MessageDelete`, `MessageDeletePermanent`, `MessageRestore`, `MessageArchive`, `MessageMarkJunk`, `MessageToggleFlag`, `ComposeSend`, `ComposeAttach`, `ComposeDiscard`, `ComposeClose`**: GPUI action types declared via the `actions!` macro under the `bgmail` namespace. Each is a zero-sized dispatch token wired to menus, key bindings, and `cx.on_action` handlers in `main.rs`.
- **struct `MoveMessageToFolder`**: Parameterized action carrying a folder storage path (`path: SharedString`). Dispatched when the user picks a move target from menus or the command palette.

#### Functions / methods

_(No functions — only action types.)_
